<title>USA: Federal Home Loan names John Gibbons as CFO.</title>
<headline>Federal Home Loan names John Gibbons as CFO.</headline>
<dateline>MCLEAN, Va. 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Home Loan Mortgage Corp said on Tuesday it has named John Gibbons chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Gibbons has been the interim chief financial officer since January, when he replaced Richard Daniel. Daniel resigned to join Bankers Trust.</p>
